Subject: [PATCH] Preserve original OS reset source with native SDK thread registry
Upstream-base: f1e9646a7da6950143e77b1daed33a92c931a638
Purpose: Canonical compiler declarations and full-width native thread-list ABI; original shutdown algorithms retained.

diff --git a/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/os/OS.h b/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/os/OS.h
